{"4392380": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Sunrise", "steam_appid": 4392380, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WELCOME TO SOLARIS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sunrise is a multi-genre, primarily 2D platformer high-speed hack and slash, featuring the ability to create and share levels you make to the world. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PICK UP THE PACE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On a mysterious day in the land of Solaris, the mayor who has been missing for 4 weeks, returns with the intent of violence, sending shockwaves across the world with a magic device, powerful enough to wipe anything from existence. With this newfound power, he shoots it up at the most important thing, the device powering the artificial sun. Now, with all light gone across the world, it's up to you, Dash, a naive robot and his 3 friends to retrieve the pieces of the device, put them together, and stop the mayor before there's nothing left.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >IMAGINATION STATION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Sunrise Editor allows you to create levels using the same tools we use to make our built-in story levels! Go wild and imagine something cool and new, with new features and possibilities being added almost every update.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE OVERVIEW</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Currently included features in Sunrise are:</strong></i></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Sunrise Editor + Steam Workshop Support &amp; Playable Custom Levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1 Playable Character (Dash), and his high-speed move-set</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Finish Line, Springpads, Boost Orbs, and more mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chapter 1's Introductory Cutscene Demo + Gameplay Tutorial</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete Soundtrack Unique to Everything In-Game</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p 