itor + Steam Workshop Support &amp; Playable Custom Levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1 Playable Character (Dash), and his high-speed move-set</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Finish Line, Springpads, Boost Orbs, and more mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chapter 1's Introductory Cutscene Demo + Gameplay Tutorial</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete Soundtrack Unique to Everything In-Game</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The feeling that some things don't feel right...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>...but, coming soon to Sunrise include:</strong></i></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online Play &amp; Level Downloads / Uploads</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Finished Story Mode with 5 Total Chapters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Shop, Upgrade Cards, 3 Other Playable Characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...and more planned...</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Sunrise is a 2D platformer high-speed hack and slash, featuring the ability to create and share levels you make to the world!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4392380/e0e2dfc3cc6e8e0d15807269eb7c185d18fa05fd/header.jpg?t=1785281809", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4392380/07091d6098b16c739d8348e7278941a9da0c2762/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1785281809", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4392380/07091d6098b16c739d8348e7278941a9da0c2762/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1785281809", "website": "https://wushroomstudios.com/sunrise", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a